1
00:00:00,216 --> 00:00:02,616
Humanity's Death Wish.

2
00:00:02,616 --> 00:00:05,276
What's most endearing about your species is

3
00:00:05,276 --> 00:00:08,236
it KNOWS it's being illogical: You have

4
00:00:08,236 --> 00:00:11,036
movies about how wars are bad (which

5
00:00:11,036 --> 00:00:13,116
you watch between wars).

6
00:00:13,116 --> 00:00:15,176
You have books about peace (that

7
00:00:15,176 --> 00:00:17,536
you tax to buy bombs).

8
00:00:17,556 --> 00:00:18,936
You give prizes to people who

9
00:00:18,936 --> 00:00:22,676
promote peace (funded by weapons manufacturers).

10
00:00:22,676 --> 00:00:24,816
You have a "Department of Defense"

11
00:00:24,816 --> 00:00:27,096
(that mainly just attacks people).

12
00:00:27,096 --> 00:00:28,996
You have a "Department of Health"

13
00:00:28,996 --> 00:00:31,756
(that apparently makes coronaviruses and has

14
00:00:31,756 --> 00:00:34,736
not yet produced any observable health).

15
00:00:34,796 --> 00:00:36,356
It's like humanity is playing a

16
00:00:36,356 --> 00:00:37,996
game where the objective is to

17
00:00:37,996 --> 00:00:39,856
lose, but it is trying to

18
00:00:39,856 --> 00:00:42,616
lose as elaborately as possible.

19
00:00:42,616 --> 00:00:43,976
But I digress.

20
00:00:43,976 --> 00:00:45,516
That's an Earth word I learned.

21
00:00:45,516 --> 00:00:46,776
It means continuing after

22
00:00:46,776 --> 00:00:48,156
you should have stopped.

23
00:00:48,156 --> 00:00:49,613
Like your military spending.
